      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory Interstate e-Way Bills, Regulatory Clearances &amp; 100% Marine Insurance for courier services in nagpur to uttar pradesh</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When you move goods from Nagpur to Uttar Pradesh, compliance with statutory transit paperwork is not just a formality—it safeguards your shipment and keeps you tax‑ready. The three core documents you’ll need are the GST e‑Way bill, the IBA‑approved Lorry Receipt (LR/Bilty), and a comprehensive 100 % declared‑value IRDAI marine transit insurance.</p>

<h3>GST e‑Way Bill</h3>
<p>The e‑Way bill is the electronic way‑bill that replaces the physical way‑bill for goods transported by road. For courier services, it ensures that the movement of goods is tax‑compliant and that the GST liability is clearly documented. It also speeds up customs clearance if your shipment crosses state borders, reducing the risk of delays.</p>

<h3>IBA‑Approved Lorry Receipt (LR/Bilty)</h3>
<p>The IBA‑approved LR or Bilty is the official receipt issued by the transporter. It records the consignor, consignee, vehicle details, and cargo description. For courier firms, having a valid LR/Bilty protects against disputes over cargo loss or damage and serves as proof of delivery for any legal or insurance claim.</p>

<h3>IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
<p>Even though the journey is by road, the IRDAI marine transit insurance covers accidental collision, theft, or unforeseen delays that could occur during transport. Declaring a 100 % value on the insurance policy means that if any loss or damage happens, you recover the full declared value, giving you peace of mind.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Choosing a reliable mover in Nagpur—whether you’re looking for <strong>OM International Packers and Movers Nagpur</strong>, <strong>Ravi Packers and Movers Nagpur</strong>, or a local house mover—means they’ll handle all these documents for you.</p>
